graph TD
    A[Transcription Signal] --> B[Transcription Factor Binding]
    B --> C[Promoter Recognition]
    C --> D[TFIID Binding]
    D --> E[TFIIA Recruitment]
    E --> F[TFIIB Binding]
    F --> G[RNA Polymerase II]
    G --> H[TFIIE/F/H Recruitment]
    H --> I[Transcription Initiation Complex]
    I --> J[DNA Unwinding]
    J --> K[First Phosphodiester Bond]
    K --> L[Transcription Initiation Complete]
    
    %% Alternative pathway
    A --> M[Enhancer Binding]
    M --> N[Enhancer-Promoter Loop]
    N --> O[Transcription Activation]
    O --> B
    
    %% Regulation
    L --> P[Transcription Status]
    P --> Q{Transcription Required?}
    Q -->|Yes| R[Initiation Activation]
    Q -->|No| S[Initiation Inhibition]
    
    %% Key proteins
    T[Transcription Factors] --> B
    U[TFIID] --> D
    V[TFIIA] --> E
    W[TFIIB] --> F
    X[RNA Polymerase II] --> G
    Y[TFIIE] --> H
    Z[TFIIF] --> H
    AA[TFIIH] --> H
    BB[Enhancers] --> M
    
    %% Styling
    style A fill:#ff6b6b
    style B fill:#feca57
